            <profile id="3461-34d9-ba8c-ee41" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="fcb9-17be-94c2-bcfc" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Warriors have hand weapon, javelins, throwing spear and buckler. Light Infantry. Warband. May upgrade to shield (+1) or large shield (+2). Up to 2 units may have light armour (+2). The total number of slave warriors may not outnumber the Illyrian warriors in the army. Illyrian units ignore panic tests caused by slave warriors.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile id="74b0-1ea2-6459-28fd" name="Armour Save" hidden="false" typeId="0dbe-f4ed-ef08-8e86" typeName="Armour Save">
